          "text_lv": "ΔrH° = Σ ν·ΔfH°(produkti) − Σ ν·ΔfH°(reaģenti); vienkāršām vielām standarta stāvoklī ΔfH° = 0.",
          "citation": {"kind": "convention", "id": "CIT-C4-ENTHALPY"}
        },
        {
          "layer": 4,
          "kind": "first_step",
          "text_lv": "Pārbaudi stehiometriskos koeficientus un agregātstāvokļus, tad aprēķini atsevišķi produktu un reaģentu summas.",
          "citation": {"kind": "concept", "id": "P4-02"}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "family_id": "FAM-4C",
      "topic": 4,
      "title_lv": "ΔG un temperatūras robeža",
      "status": "authored",
      "concept_ids": ["P4-02", "P4-08", "P4-10", "P4-11"],
      "primary_concept_id": "P4-10",
      "max_depth_by_variant_class": {"default": 4},
      "depth_rule_applied": false,
      "item_overrides": {},
      "layers": [
        {
          "layer": 1,
          "kind": "cue",
          "text_lv": "Saskaņo ΔH un ΔS enerģijas vienības (abas kJ vai abas J) un pārveido temperatūru kelvinos.",
          "citation": {"kind": "concept", "id": "P4-10"}
        },
        {
          "layer": 2,
          "kind": "concept_link",
          "concept_id": "P4-10",
          "text_lv": "Atver koncepta atvilktni par Gibsa brīvo enerģiju un patvaļīguma kritēriju (P4-10).",
          "citation": {"kind": "concept", "id": "P4-10"}
        },
        {
          "layer": 3,
          "kind": "rule_citation",
          "text_lv": "Lieto ΔG = ΔH − T·ΔS un T/K = t/°C + 273,15; ΔG < 0 norāda uz termodinamiski patvaļīgu procesu.",
          "citation": {"kind": "convention", "id": "CIT-C4-GIBBS"}
        },
        {
          "layer": 4,
          "kind": "first_step",
          "text_lv": "Pārrēķini ΔS no J/(mol·K) uz kJ/(mol·K) un temperatūru K, tad ievieto vienādojumā (vai pielīdzini ΔG = 0 robežai).",
          "citation": {"kind": "convention", "id": "CIT-C2-TEMP"}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
